# Version only deliberately reviewed, fictional/public fixtures.
!/samples/*.csv
!/tests/fixtures/**/*.csv
!/tests/fixtures/**/*.json
!tests/fixtures/translation_intelligence/fictional_master_accounts.xlsx
!tests/fixtures/translation_intelligence/fictional_source_accounts.xlsx

# Sensitive JSON remains excluded even under a fixture exception.
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/*resume*token*.json
